  "styleBlock": "Warm editorial look. Deep cedar green (#1F4E3D) and cream (#E9DCC9) on an off-white page (#FBF8F3), with a brass accent (#B8894A). Large serif headings (Fraunces) over clean Inter body text. Asymmetric layouts, big photography, generous whitespace, thin dividers instead of boxes, small corner radii and almost no shadows. Feels like a handwritten family menu, not a template.",
